Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FallingBarrelOnRoad" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :pedestrian1, :vehicle1 ;
    :hasObstacle :barrel1 ;
    :hasEvidence :indicator1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :foggy1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Person standing near the van" .
:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Van parked on the roadside" .
:barrel1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Falling barrel obstructing the lane" .
:foggy1 a :FoggyCondition .
:indicator1 a :FallingObjectIndicator ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Collision with falling barrel on the road" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision with falling barrel on the road
Severity Score: 0.9